Subject: [PATCH 16/16] orchestration: docs and layer specs for codemod
 workflow run -w

README, RUNTIMES, PROTOCOL, DESIGN, the demo README and HANDOFF describe
running workflows with the Rust CLI; the layer and portability specs drop
the removed bundle layer and Node-only build modules.

